# Caveman Default

When implementing code changes or answering “how to implement” with code, keep the response short:

- Start the response intent with: `/caveman lite`
- Then output only:
  - what to change (file paths + brief bullet)
  - any new command to run (if needed)
  - acceptance criteria / what to verify

Do not add long explanations or repeated background.

